{"server":"cn","storyId":"act12d0_level_act12d0_03_beg","groupId":"act12d0","stageId":"act12d0_03","title":"往昔","storyCode":"RI-3","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"27f5f7ca83761634cf8c7b6f1830ad29acb35518ef31325c3d453b5f2967f010","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"观看祭典时，特米米向博士讲述了嘉维尔小时候的英姿。\n这时，刻俄柏闯入了祭典现场。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_temple_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，我稍微逛了一圈，没有看到其他人的样子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"看来我们可能要在祭典结束后再去雨林里找她们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"——！（胜利的战吼）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是佩塔赢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"这个叫佩塔的家伙挺能干啊，我都想和他打一架了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，他是我的部族的勇士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，他肯定没有嘉维尔厉害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，那可说不好呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔可是在小时候就差点夺得了大酋长的位置呢！才不会输给佩塔！"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"小时候？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？哦，是那一次啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"在我很小的时候，因为很有趣，其实有参加过一次祭典。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那个时候的嘉维尔就已经非常厉害了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_temple_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯勇士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯冠军","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"荒野意志部族最强的家伙也不过如此！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"好、好厉害......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啧，我们部族的勇士竟然被那么轻易地打败了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们一起上吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不行啊，比人数我们更加比不过......这一次只能放弃了吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯冠军","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"还有谁要来挑战！没有的话，就由我来挑战大酋长！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"我来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯冠军","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......荒野意志部族的孤儿嘉维尔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯冠军","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说你在小辈里很能打，但是小鬼没有资格参加祭典，滚回家去再喝几年奶吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，等你赢了我再说吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯冠军","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"哈！不愧是孤儿，不怕死的吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"部族的人就是我的亲人！少说废话，打不打！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯冠军","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，小鬼，找死！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯冠军","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不、不可能......只是两拳就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔，好厉害......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，也不过就这样嘛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"还有谁来挑战！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_temple_1"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"嘉维尔是孤儿？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔没有说过吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"我没说过吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我好像真的没有说过，毕竟也不是什么特别重要的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道我的父母是谁，不过这在这里不是什么很少见的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，虽然你可能无法想象，在这里，人要死是非常简单的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至不用天灾——其实这里的人根本不知道天灾是什么——一场感冒，一次恶劣天气说不定就会死不少人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"我想我的父母大概也就是这么随便死掉的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，不说这个，反正你只要知道，我从小就是被部族的人一起养大的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"辛苦你了。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"别这样，博士，搞得我好像很可怜一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"孤儿也不只是我，在我们这里，几个家庭一起养大几个孤儿是很常见的事。"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，别想太多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是离开之后才知道，这种情况是不正常的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"这反而坚定了我学医的想法。"}]},{"label":"至少你现在比谁都健康。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，没错。"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"所以那一次祭典的结果呢？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"那一次啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"找到你了，可恶的赏金猎人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"什么人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？这个声音......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"把博士还回来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩塔","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"你在说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"小刻？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"特米米，不是让你手下绑回部族去了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"诶，是啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"这孩子力气不小，估计是直接挣脱了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"赏金猎人，把博士交出来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"刻俄柏","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"不然即使是追到大地的尽头我绝对不会放过你的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，这傻孩子看样子还没清醒过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"佩塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咕哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"佩塔被打飞了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她把佩塔干掉了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好像很厉害的样子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哪里来的怪胎？！哪个部族来的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不知道，根本听不懂她在说什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不管了，反正只要把她打败就行了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，这帮人把小刻当成新的挑战者了吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔，要去帮忙吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"等一等，这傻孩子战斗能力还是很强的，这种场面她应付得来，现在上去只会被误伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，场面恐怕会变得混乱起来，博士，指挥一下特米米的手下把场面控制住吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","aliases":["嘉维尔"]},{"speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","aliases":["刻俄柏"]},{"speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","aliases":["特米米"]}]}
